{"id": "17-2877-2-6", "zh": "在被动（kamma）语态中：anvabhavissatha、anvabhavissisu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2877-7-10", "zh": "或作 anvabhūyissatha 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2877-11-15", "zh": "用为他词（parassapada）时：anvabhavissa、anvabhavissaṃsu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2877-16-19", "zh": "或作 anvabhūyissa 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2877-20-25", "zh": "在无人称（bhāva）语态中：abhavissatha devadattena（天授本会成为），abhūyissatha。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-2878-2-22", "zh": "同样：如果他得到了那笔财物，就会煮饭——apacissa、pacissa，或 apacissā、pacissā；apacissaṃsu、pacissaṃsu。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2878-23-35", "zh": "apacissa、pacissa，或 apacisse、pacisse；apacissatha、pacissatha。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2878-36-48", "zh": "apacissaṃ、pacissaṃ；apacissamha、pacissamha，或 apacissāmhā、pacissāmhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2878-49-56", "zh": "apacissatha、pacissatha；apacissisu、pacissisu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2878-57-64", "zh": "apacissase、pacissase；apacissavhe、pacissavhe。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2878-65-72", "zh": "apacissiṃ、pacissiṃ；apacissāmhase、pacissāmhase。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2879-2-8", "zh": "在被动语态中：apacissatha odano devadattena（饭本会被天授煮），apacissisu。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2879-9-13", "zh": "如果 ya 词缀不脱落，就作 apacīyissatha 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2879-14-29", "zh": "用为他词时：apaccissa tena（被他煮）、paccissa，或 apaccissā、paccissā；apaccissaṃsu、paccissaṃsu 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-2880-2-14", "zh": "他：agacchissa、gacchissa，或 agacchissā、gacchissā；agacchissaṃsu、gacchissaṃsu。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2880-15-28", "zh": "你：agacchissa、gacchissa，或 agacchisse、gacchisse；agacchissatha、gacchissatha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2880-29-41", "zh": "agacchissaṃ、gacchissaṃ；agacchissamha、gacchissamha，或 agacchissāmhā、gacchissāmhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2880-42-54", "zh": "agamissa、gamissa，或 agamissā、gamissā；agamissaṃsu、gamissaṃsu。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2880-55-65", "zh": "agamissa、gamissa，或 agamisse；agamissatha、gamissatha。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2880-66-79", "zh": "agamissaṃ、gamissaṃ；agamissamha、gamissamha，或 agamissāmhā、gamissāmhā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2880-80-85", "zh": "或作 agacchissatha、gacchissatha 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "17-2881-2-10", "zh": "在被动语态中：agacchīyissatha、agamīyissatha、agacchīyissa、agamīyissa 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "17-2881-11-16", "zh": "同样：aghammissā、aghammissaṃsu 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "17-2882-2-3", "zh": "时过（kālātipatti）语尾。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-2883-2-6", "zh": "命令式、愿望式、现在式用于现在与未来；", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "17-2884-2-6", "zh": "未来式也是如此；完成式等四种属于过去时。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "17-2885-2-3", "zh": "六时语尾的规定。", "confidence": 65}
